Started on Google Cloud video

00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:22.360
that we have for you in
the description box below,

00:04:22.360 --> 00:04:25.480
just to get a quick run-through
of the Google Cloud console,

00:04:25.480 --> 00:04:28.480
